test.yaml:12:9: this step checks out code from the pull request that was commented on (gh pr checkout) in a "issue_comment" workflow and "make" runs it afterwards. the workflow has a write token and secrets, so whoever controls that code can use them. run untrusted code in a "pull_request" workflow without secrets, or check out the base branch and only read the pull request as data [untrusted-checkout]
test.yaml:22:16: this step checks out code from the pull request that was commented on (refs/pull/${{ github.event.issue.number }}/head) in a "issue_comment" workflow and "npm" runs it afterwards. the workflow has a write token and secrets, so whoever controls that code can use them. run untrusted code in a "pull_request" workflow without secrets, or check out the base branch and only read the pull request as data [untrusted-checkout]
